# Frontend Conventions (BookShelf Web)

- Build UI with React function components and keep component logic readable and focused.
- Route all backend requests through `src/lib/api.ts`; do not call `fetch` directly in components.
- Import shared interfaces from the API module using type-only imports:
  - `import type { Book } from "../lib/api"`
- Keep styling aligned with project design language:
  - cream background tones
  - brown text
  - forest-green accents/focus states
- Maintain responsive book grid behavior: 1 column (mobile), 2 columns (tablet), 3 columns (desktop).
- Prefer Tailwind utility classes for layout and visual styling consistency.
